Create/sign in the account again (same email as before is fine: haydncampbell22@gmail.com).
Wait until profiles exists for that user (signup completes / trigger ran — usually immediate).
In SQL Editor (or MCP again), run:
UPDATE public.profiles p
SET master_control = 'yes'
FROM auth.users u
WHERE p.id = u.id
  AND lower(coalesce(u.email, '')) = lower('haydncampbell22@gmail.com');
PIN: Because profiles were deleted, master_pin_hash is gone. In the app, open Master control → Set PIN (or your existing pin setup flow) and save a new 6-digit PIN before using gated master actions.

Sign out and sign back in (or restart the app) so master_control is refreshed from Supabase into AuthContext.

cd expo-app
eas build --profile development --platform ios